# (build 160) The rumble when the party falls: a level-1 Rolf against
# Mother Brain (gameover_to_sega's way in), FIGHT. Its first blow takes
# all his HP: hurt and fell in the same tick, both motors full, as it
# lands; then the game over screen, the longest shake (held 60, down over
# 90 at HIGH).

start battle $103
party 1 1
rumble-log motors.txt 3
limit 4000
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect rumble hurt 1
expect rumble fell 1
expect stat 0 hp 0
press c
wait screen gameover
expect rumble lost 1
expect rumble going
wait ticks 160
expect rumble still
